      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thus the heavens and the earth were finished, and all the host of them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And on the seventh day God ended his work which he had made; and he rested on the seventh day from all his work which he had made.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And God blessed the seventh day, and sanctified it: because that in it he had rested from all his work which God created and made.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ These",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.2.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.2.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the generations of the heavens and of the earth when they were created, in the day that the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.2.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.2.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "God made the earth and the heavens,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And every plant of the field before it was in the earth, and every herb of the field before it grew: for the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.2.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.2.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "God had not caused it to rain upon the earth, and",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "there was",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.2.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.2.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "not a man to till the ground.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But there went up a mist from the earth, and watered the whole face of the ground.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.2.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.2.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "God formed man",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "of",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.2.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.2.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the dust of the ground, and breathed into his nostrils the breath of life; and man became a living soul.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
