          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ And the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.2.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.2.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "God planted a garden eastward in Eden; and there he put the man whom he had formed.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And out of the ground made the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.2.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.2.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "God to grow every tree that is pleasant to the sight, and good for food; the tree of life also in the midst of the garden, and the tree of knowledge of good and evil.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And a river went out of Eden to water the garden; and from thence it was parted, and became into four heads.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The name of the first",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.2.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.2.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pison: that",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.2.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.2.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "it which compasseth the whole land of Havilah, where",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "there is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.2.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.2.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
